---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import StarryNight from '../images/StarryNight.jpg';
---

<figure>
  <Image src={StarryNight} alt="Starry Night" />
  <figcaption>
The Starry Night, one of Vincent van Gogh's most celebrated works, is a moderately abstract landscape painting of an expressive night sky over a hillside village. He painted it in 1889 during his 12-month stay at the Saint-Paul-de-Mausole asylum near Saint-Rémy-de-Provence, France.
</figcaption>
</figure>